From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fluorite Integration Role
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:35:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] filament-view: add shapes after renderable creation

Filament ignores entities added to a Scene before they have a Renderable or
Light component. Build the shape first, then add its entity to the scene so
the primitive is actually rendered.

---
 .../filament_view/core/systems/derived/shape_system.cc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/systems/derived/shape_system.cc b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/systems/derived/shape_system.cc
--- a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/systems/derived/shape_system.cc
+++ b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/systems/derived/shape_system.cc
@@ -159,1 +159,0 @@
-  filamentScene->addEntity(oEntity);
@@ -163,0 +164,1 @@
+  filamentScene->addEntity(oEntity);
